WEBVTT

00:00:00.358 --> 00:00:07.334
tablet and iPad mode. Here is how to use the vNAAATS display on a tablet while your own scope stays on your Windows computer.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:14.950
Start in FDD for Windows, signed in as normal with your position chosen, then press Settings.

00:00:16.134 --> 00:00:20.070
In the settings window, find the box called tablet or iPad mode.

00:00:21.702 --> 00:00:23.430
Press "Show Link in QR Code".

00:00:23.846 --> 00:00:28.966
The code appears with the link written underneath. The link works once and it lasts five minutes.

00:00:30.022 --> 00:00:38.054
On the tablet, scan the code with the camera or type the link into the browser. The display opens, already signed in as you, with your position.

00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:48.390
Three things to remember, EuroScope stays on your Windows computer, so buttons that type into it still go through your plugin. The link works once, so if it expires, just make a new one.

00:00:48.646 --> 00:00:52.806
and on an iPad, choose Share, then add to Home screen for a full screen icon.

